<p>shabeehe imaame zamaa'n khainchte hai<br />
tasawwur me tasweere jaa'n khainchte hai</p>

<p>Jagah mol li hai mazaaro'n ki qaatir<br />
shahe dee'n zamee'n par nishaa'n khainchte hai</p>

<p>ajab haal hai dukhtare fatima ka<br />
rida sar se eeza rasaa'n khainchte hai</p>

<p>kahaa'n paaye abid kahaa'n dohri bedi<br />
ye langar kahee'n naatawaa'n khainchte hai</p>

<p>kaha roke akbar ne ae dard tham ja<br />
ke seene se baba sina khainchte hai</p>

<p>pukaari sakina dohaayi hai baba<br />
sitamgar meri baaliyaa'n khainchte hai<br />
</p>